== Promotion beats (Oct 11–18) ==

* Day 19 playoff footage leads every news package: the lariat kickout, the Samoan driver, the bow.
* Vance does zero media. The silence holds until the Dome. Taumafa does all of it — the family carries the promotion week.
* Episode build (Oct 14): contract signing for Wrestling Summit is held in advance — champion, and an empty chair for the G1 winner. Vance or Taumafa signs at the Dome, post-match.
* Leoni appears once, on the go-home show: ''"I don't care which of you wins. I've beaten the giant. I've never beaten the silence. Come and show me."''

== Notes ==

* KAZUKI/Kuroki semi-main protects the grudge and gives the Dome a second main-event-quality singles match.
* The 6-man puts Kawada, Takagi, and Kengo on the card without singles matches the card can't pace.
* Jusuf/Reyes keeps both heels strong for the post-Summit scene.
* If Vance's promo lands, the Wrestling Summit build writes itself: the Workhorse who never talked against the Chief who never stopped.
